yo what up space fam golson here from  anime upper and i'm back at it again  with another hype one piece topic today  we'll be talking about the new  generation of yonko that's already been  revealed to us in the story if we paid  close attention so make sure to stay  tuned for that if you do enjoy these  one-piece videos and want to keep them  coming you know what to do chill parking  within and smash that like button  remember smashing his pirating energy  and passing his scared orochi energy so  choose wisely if you haven't make this  video subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and updates before you  watch the whole video leave a comment  for your predictions about the next  generation of yonko and who will make up  these yonko and lastly while you wait  for the next chapter to drop feel free  to check out my huge and growing  one-piece playlist that includes videos  on all the old yonko warlords mythical  zones and more link to that is in the  description and now without further ado  let's jump into it spoilers and all so  we know the yonko are the four emperors  of the sea and i even had to be told  this back in the day but there can only  be four at one time because in the  japanese four is in the word yonko so  even when luffy was proclaimed the fifth  emperor he wasn't actually being called  ayanko which assumes being in one of the  top four emperor positions so believe it  or not even though many of us have come  to think of luffy as an emperor by now  he hasn't yet officially been proclaimed  a yonko the current yonko are kaido big  mom shanks and the newest one blackbeard  who replaced whitebeard whitebeard was  72 at his death big mom is currently 68  years old kaido is currently 59 shanks  is 39 and blackbeard is 40. so based off  of ages alone big mom and kaido in  particular are associated with the older  generation and are thus the most likely  to be replaced big mom is almost the age  whitebeard was when he died and that's  not even mentioning how much of her  lifespan she probably already sacrificed  through the use of her food powers we  know that she was pushed by awakened law  and awakened kid to the point where she  had to use an entire year of her  lifespan to strengthen herself she even  said at this point and i quote i'm sure  you've come for my throne so take it if  you can prove you're worthy of being an  emperor of the sea end quote and that's  exactly what they do some will argue  that big mom can still be an emperor she  got knocked off the island sure but they  didn't kill her and had to work together  to beat her however oda emphasizes that  the battle should not be read like that  as they're beating her law says and i  quote your era is over end quote oda  furthermore announces kit and law as the  winners it's there in black and white  and their crew celebrates saying they  beat big mom calling it huge news  monumental even so when we consider her  age her sacrifice lifespan her defeat  here her being an old mom and all the  other quotes set in this arc it's clear  that big mom's time is over and she will  no longer be considered a yonko after  news of her defeat by the new generation  comes out perhaps if she had her crew  around her she could have maintained her  public image a while longer but there's  no coming back from this now in my  opinion so who will replace her as we  discuss there can only be 4 yonko so law  and kid can't just replace big mom  together we know that luffy will be a  yonko more on that in a bit so the only  way both can become yonko is if  off-screen blackbeard manages to beat  shanks and in this way mirrors luffy's  success at wano however since shanks is  so young and since he's such a fan  favorite and been hyped up so much it  would be pretty anticlimactic for him to  just lose off screen so what's more  likely is that it has to be either 23  year old kid or 26 year old law who step  in to replace big mom and i think it's  pretty clear that it's going to be kid  in my chapter reviews i've consistently  been pointing out how kid exhibits more  of that pirate king or you might say  luffy energy than law does i mean he  even has conker's haki like luffy does  while law doesn't and goldie roger and  every yonko except blackbeard have  already been confirmed to have conker's  hockey and in my opinion blackbeard  definitely has it too some people argue  that blackbeard will rely on purely  devil fruits to fight luffy's hockey but  i just don't see such a built up  antagonist not also being skilled in  hockey especially since we know haki  trumps devil fruits as you climb higher  in the pirate world aside from law not  having conquerors haki oda always makes  it clear that law is usually reacting to  kid rather than the other way around  throughout the fight the law gets ticked  off when kidd follows up law's attacks  with big fancy attacks that make it look  like kids the actual deciding factor in  the big mom fight law freaks out saying  and i quote i'm not your opening act and  quote and kid responds who cares about  that it's not important right now and in  this case kid is acting much more like  goldie roger or luffy than law is and  despite law desperately trying to take a  man of the situation so that he can get  the credit for beating big mom the  battle eventually ends with a big flashy  attack from kid yes law helps but he's  more like a shadow helping behind the  scenes while kid has that flashy star of  the show's style that will no doubt make  him the star of this battle in the  public's view and as we know public  perception is important for deciding who  will be a yonko and the list of reasons  go on like law's crew is pretty much  helpless during the war while kid has  killer another supernova on his crew  just like luffy has zorro kit has also  always felt like more of a rival to  luffy even having a bigger bounty than  him at one point while la pretty much  feels like a crew member at this point  then there's the fact that kids face  shanks kaido and big mom and come out  stronger than ever during this latest  fight kit has the same goal of becoming  pirate king as luffy while law has  developed other interests like finding  out the meaning of the poneglyphs the  d-clan and their fate and in short the  secrets of the world the good news for  law fans though is that his motivations  make it more likely he'll be there to  assist luffy on his journey while kid as  a rival yonko will not be so willing to  cooperate with him down the line then  there's luffy the new sun god and the  new joy boy he shall come out on top  sooner or later and replace kaido the  second oldest current member of the  yonko i don't think that this will come  as a surprise to anyone since the dude  was already considered the fifth emperor  and he's gotten way stronger since then  and awakened his mythical zone god fruit  to boot his first mate has already  beaten kaido's first mate sanji has  already beaten queen 2 and the list of  victories just goes on so the crew is  definitely already worthy to be called a  yonko crew also unless blackbeard has  been doing some truly crazy things in  the background it's likely that luffy  will have the highest bounty we've ever  seen even higher than goldie rogers  because he'll have beaten the strongest  creature in the world and he'll be the  government's worst case scenario as the  breathing living sun god nika a dude who  literally makes the impossible possible  and who serves as a symbol of freedom  for all the people who are being  oppressed by the world government and  the celestial dragons thus luffy will  easily earn the yonko title after the  events of wano it'll be interesting to  see what happens with kaido after the  defeat if he does survive but i strongly  believe that after luffy beats him  physically and philosophically that the  already unstable kaido will no longer be  a yonko especially since he recently  pretty much said he lost everything  because of the war just like big mom is  symbolically an old mother who needs to  make way for the new generation kaido's  crew is filled with extinct animals like  dinosaurs a fact which to me also serves  to foreshadow his and his crew's  inevitable downfall the old must make  way for the new then of course  blackbeard will stay a yonko i think  most of us can agree that he's been set  up to be one of luffy's final and most  important antagonists if not the  absolute final one i strongly believe  that he will either do something  significant behind the scenes or that he  will show up and do something  significant at wano which will propel  his status and bounty forward as well we  can also imagine that he'll absorb  certain things from kaido and big mom  just like he did from whitebeard whether  it be kaido's fruit like a lot of people  think or whether it be just territory in  my mind the fact that blackbeard's with  moria right now still strongly suggests  that they will show up in wano since  moria is burning to get revenge against  kaido lastly shanks who is even younger  than blackbeard will probably stay yonko  being the only one of the original yonko  of the old era to stay a yonko in the  new era if blackbeard beat him off  screen which like i said would be an  extremely anticlimactic thing to do then  perhaps law could replace him but as i  pointed out earlier despite helping to  beat big mom there's so many reasons  that law is just not on the level of the  other three that to me it further  solidifies the idea that shanks will  stay a yonko at least for the immediate  to near future while luffy's next big  opponent could be blackbeard shanks  could be kid's next target although for  now it is hard to picture kid and his  crew getting strong enough to take  shanks on the idea is probably laughable  to many fans but we know that kid does  have history with shanks and he does  seem like the kind of guy who'd come  back stronger and try to get revenge for  his lost arm it might be a kind of there  can only be one red-haired yonko kind of  situation either way if shanks must be  defeated down the line by whoever i  really hope that it happens on screen  and we fully see what he and his crew  are capable of before the defeat happens  kid definitely has motive to try to beat  him at least even if he doesn't succeed  and he clearly confronted them when he  was way weaker than he is now so there's  no doubt in my mind that he'd try to do  it again considering how much stronger  he is and that is it for the next  generation of yonko do you agree that  luffy kid blackbeard and shanks will be  the new generation or do you have a  different combo in mind or maybe you  think the yanko system will be disbanded  all together let me know what you think  in the comments if you did enjoy this  video and want to keep them coming you  know what to do channel parking within  and smash that like button remember  smashing is parking energy and passing  is scared of rochi energy so choose  wisely if you haven't make this the  video subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and updates and while  you wait for the next video or chapter  to drop feel free to check out my huge  and growing one-piece playlist that  includes videos on all the old yonko  warlords mythical zones and much more  link to that is in the description and  until next time see ya space cowboys

